      "text": "We're live! piped.video/live/mzTC90Z2u4s\n\n\n\nMeghan McCain (@MeghanMcCain)\n\nIt was a great weekend to be an American \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\u2764\ufe0f\n\nToday at noon ET: Recapping UFC, World Cup, and Europeans discovering all of America's greatest treasures.\n\nJoin me &amp; @bungarsargon LIVE! piped.video/mzTC90Z2u4s\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/MeghanMcCain/status/2066530288734224714#m",
