      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Mark Halperin (@MarkHalperin)\n\nI can't decide if people on X are more (1) inexplicably unable to get sarcastic tweets OR (2) just plain stupid.\n\nIt's a very tough call.\n\nThus, I turn to @bdomenech and @MeghanMcCain to tell us all the answer.\n\nWhich is it, folks?\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/MarkHalperin/status/2066317868891856925#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2066327891667832978",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-15T01:12:14+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "America is so much cooler than every other country on earth and it isn\u2019t even a competition. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n\nNitro Circus (@NitroCircus)\n\nGod Bless America \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \nFirst look at the historic Freedom Jump. \n@blckriflecoffee \n@TravisPastrana @mmgeneral @Jeremymcgrath__ @RickyCarmichael @twitchthis\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/NitroCircus/status/2065852068951388335#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2066203874470285652",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-14T16:59:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
